get started  don't wait for conditions to be perfect  before you actually do something because  by the time you figure it all out you'll  have missed your window of opportunity  you have to get started and get started  today do something even if it's a small  thing start building some momentum i got  a question from valerie who's a youtube  viewer  love you guys on youtube wrote in you  know i have the equipment to do a  youtube video i want to get started on  youtube but i have to find somebody to  help me set this up for my business what  do i do  you don't need somebody valerie you can  start on your own don't wait for  somebody else to get in this for you to  start making a successful youtube video  start and if your goal is to build  something big with it you will find  resources people connections to help you  out  when i first started on youtube i wanted  to do it because i was a visual learner  i wanted to be able to share and answer  the same question a lot of people are  having instead of just helping that one  person i could put on youtube make a  video and help tons of people that was  the main goal and my first video sucked  you know i was nervous the camera  equipment was was terrible the lighting  was off the sound was off but i just  started  that's the key you start you look at the  product that you create you want to make  it better  you have standards right you want to  start increasing the quality here  and part of that's going to come from  you doing research  so i research better cameras i  researched tripods i researched  microphones i came from feedback from my  users the people who are watching videos  said i love the video but the sound  quality kind of sucks  so okay i got to get a microphone  and i started improving the quality  gradually  i brought on a team of people to help me  so  i do the videos myself so i'm in my  office i've just got a sony camcorder or  handycam whatever it is i got a sony  microphone it's sitting on a tripod  and i film it and then i put it on my  google drive and i have a contractor  someone on my team who edits all the  videos  so i started editing myself and they  were crappy like they were basic editing  but it doesn't matter like you don't  need editing just put it up get started  build some momentum don't wait to find  the perfect editor before you start this  thing go start doing it practice you'll  get better  i found an editor i use odess which is a  great service  and she works for me every week  christina she's watching this video hey  christina love your work awesome keep  doing a good job and i send all the  files to her we use google drive i  upload them on my camera she puts them  uh on my youtube video channel she'll  put uh the name description all that  stuff she posted because my time now is  best spent making the videos so that's  what i do  and i've slowly built up my equipment my  technology the people who've  helped me  and i'll talk to people who are in video  and who are in  who are photographers and i say look at  my video what do you think could they be  better and they give me tips on lighting  and they give me tips on setting the  stage and distracting background all  this stuff that you learn  because you want to get better  but if you keep just learning and you  never take any action and you keep  waiting for the right person to come  along nothing is gonna happen you have a  great idea built up in your head and  you'll never take action you look back  it's like two years have gone by and  nothing has happened  so it's great to plan like plan it's  great keep that plan in mind but also do  something about it  to make a youtube video is easy  you have a camera you use your laptop  anything some kind of camera press  record start sharing your opinion make  it as powerful as impactful as you can  care about your audience  and just put it up  and it'll get better and better and  better and better and that momentum of  you actually doing work will feed  into making those videos better  and before you know you have an amazing  product on your hand with all you do is  plan you're never going to make it and i  know  i know it's hard  a lot of us are planners  a lot of us want to have everything done  perfectly before we do something and  it's and it's a fear  of something going wrong and it not  working out and it's a legitimate fear  right you don't want to create something  that sucks and it's a big failure  but you also have to work through that  fear  and not just plan i know a ton of  entrepreneurs who just plan plan plan  plan plan and and take some forever to  do something  and as a result they're building a  company that's a fraction of what it  could be  so you need to combine the planning with  actual action  so plan for your youtube channel or  whatever project it is for you the rest  of you guys watching plan for it but  also start do something now do something  today small record a video even if you  don't post it record a video on your  camera  just to see what you look like practice  make it as good as you can  build some momentum it'll feed into your  business make you better make your  company better make you more money  believe  you guys like this video thumbs up below  thank you so much it makes me want to do  more videos for you and i want to hear  you have to think comment below please  for those of you watching you like the  video please leave a comment even just  say i like this video those make my day  every day when i eat my breakfast and  i'm watching the videos and if you have  a question for your company leave it  below i will make a video response for  you just like i did for this one thank  you guys i'll see you soon

